window.products.push({"id":578013,"name":"Green Eucalyptus Wreath with Berries for Front Door, 18'' Artificial Green Wreath for Spring Summer, Farmhouse Wreath with Welcome Sign, Plaid Bow for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YUPyfd3KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lifelike and Full: The eucalyptus wreath is handmade, features eucalyptus leaves, boxwood, white/pink flowers and white berries, making the wreath full, natural and realistic.Its elegance add a vibrant and pleasant vibe to your home. The Welcome sign and white-black plaid bow makes the wreath more practical for welcome friends and family. Handmade:This artificial eucalyptus wreath for front door is made by hand. The eucalyptus leaves are made of silk cloth, boxwood leaves made of plastic and white berries are made of PE material. It doesn't need water and special cleaning. Can be used for a long time. Premium Material: This green eucalyptus wreath is made of silk, plastic and PE.The base is full of faux silk eucalyptus leaves and clusters of realistic berries.It can maintain a lifelike state in the absence of sunlight and water,the encrypted design makes the wreath look more realistic, revealing the feeling of vitality,bringing more nature into your home. Proper Size:The artificial eucalyptus wreath door decor is approx 18 inches in outer diameter and approx 12 inches in inner diameter.Appropriate size make it as perfect decoration for front door decor, front porch , wall ,window or just as a farmhouse welcome sign. Versatile Decor:This gorgeous wreath is a versatile decoration. It can hang on the walls, front doors, porches, bedrooms, living rooms, etc., and is perfect for indoors and outdoors, restaurants, weddings, birthdays, stores and parties. This green wreath will bring a pleasant atmosphere all year round.Its elegance will surely impress your family and friends. Excellent Combination: Package includes an artificial eucalyptus wreath,a black-and-white plaid bow,a welcome to our home sign and a sticky hook,you can diy your own style wreath!It is a good choice for home indoor outdoor decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YUPyfd3KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vintend","source_asin":"B0C59R3LSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C59R3LSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C59R3LSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
