window.products.push({"id":578059,"name":"Daanaas Ceramic Vegetable Knife 6in with Steath,Vegetable Cutting Knife Suitable for Fruits, Vegetables and Meat,Ceramic Chef Knife Lettuce Knife Naki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1WrMd6WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safe for food】Unlike general metal knives, our ceramic knives do not leave behind a metal smell during the cutting process, nor will the food turn brown. Better to keep the food fresh. 【No sharpening required】Ceramic knives are made of high- quality materials. The edges are sharp and sturdy, so there is no need to sharpen the knife during use, and it is easy to use. 【Light weight】Our ceramic knife is light weight and very easy to use. Whether you have kitchen experience or not, you can easily navigate. 【Not rust】Our ceramic knives do not work with any metal, won't rust, and are very easy to clean.Each knife comes with a steath for outdoor use. 【Notice】Our ceramic knife has obvious advantages in the process of cutting vegetables, fruits and meat, but do not use it as a chopper, and do not cut too hard things such as bones or frozen food. Keep the blade clean and dry when the knife is not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y1WrMd6WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daanaas","source_asin":"B0B3J4TC2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3J4TC2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3J4TC2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":578060,"name":"Cervical Pillow Memory Foam Pillows Contour Pillow for Neck Pain Orthopedic Pillow for Sleeping Neck Pillows with Washable Cover Bed Pillow for Back, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cVId1t96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【REDUCE BODY PAIN】: Do you wake up with neck pain every morning? This cervical pillow for neck pain is great for people with neck pain. Precisely provides soft comfort and firm support for neck, head, shoulders and arms and help you wake up with no more neck and shoulder pain! THIS CERVICAL PILLOW IS NOT A MEDICAL PRODUCT. IF YOU NEED TO USE IT FOR REHABILITATION, PLEASE ASK YOUR DOCTOR FOR ADVICE. 【Ergonomic Pillow】: If you have cervical problems you can sleep on the higher side of the cervical neck pillow (the side with the 2 corners) as this pillow for side sleepers provides better support for your head and neck so that your neck Maintain proper alignment with the rest of the body. Depending on your habit you can also sleep on the lower side. 【BUTTERFLY DESIGN】: This neck support pillows for sleeping has specific grooves for your arms to sleep comfortably. You can lie on your stomach, the shape of the butterfly design gives armrests, and the arms are no longer numb. 【GENTLE MEMORY FOAM】: The pillows for neck pain is made of pure memory foam core, the pillow bounces back gently within 3 to 5 seconds, it can provides soft and strong support according to your body curves. So as to keep your cervical spine, spine and breathing passages in top shape during sleep. 【REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE】: The neck pillows for sleeping comes with a pillowcase, you don't need to buy a pillowcase again, the soft fabric is more comfortable and keeps the cervical pillow breathable while you sleep. It's removable, has an invisible zipper, and is machine washable so you can always keep it clean and smelling fresh. 【WORRY-FREE SHOPPING】: We are committed to providing customers with quality products and 100% satisfactory service. If you need any assistance, please feel free to contact us. Tips: The neck pillows for pain relief sleeping itself will have a very light smell, if you can't accept it, please ventilate it for 3-5 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cVId1t96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACADGQ AA3","source_asin":"B09S9TJ665","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S9TJ665","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S9TJ665","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
