window.products.push({"id":578249,"name":"ASHOMELI Dark Grey Comforter for Twin Bed, All Season Soft Quilted Reversible Down Alternative Comforter Twin Size Duvet Insert with Corner Tabs, Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LIqeDZh-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Main Feature Material: Our comforter is made of double-sided brushed fabric, which is warm, breathable, durable and comfortable.Unique design: The edge is streamlined and has a beautiful square box stitch to prevent the filler from shifting. Sewn corner tongue secures comforter in place.Easy to maintain: Machine wash in cold water, dry in low water without tearing after washing.Guarantee: Our comforter will not pill, tear or shrink. If the above problem occurs, please contact us for a full refund. About Us ASHOMELI is a company specializing in researching, developing and selling comforters.Over the years, more than three million comforters have been sold, which has been favored by consumers. After all consumer experiences, our comforter have proven to be pilling-resistant, tear-resistant, warm and durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LIqeDZh-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASHOMELI","source_asin":"B087T78XGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087T78XGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087T78XGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":578250,"name":"Nuwave Brio 7-in-1 Air Fryer Oven, 7.25-Qt with One-Touch Digital Controls, 50°- 400°F Temperature Controls in 5° Increments, Linear Thermal (Linear T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51puhKGzs7L._AC_.jpg","description":"MAKE ADJUSTMENTS ON-THE-FLY – Want hotter temperature or need to cook it longer? No problem. Simply adjust on-the-fly. Starting the cooking process over is not necessary. Brio’s intuitive digital controls are easy to operate, and the response is immediate. Brio’s cool white display is easy-to-read in any light or no light. HEALTHY FRIED FOOD & EASY CLEANUP - Brio uses super-heated air and an efficient air-flow design to cook crispy delicious fried foods without the guilt. No more messy oil, added fats, or calories. Brio allows you to air fry all your favorites - even from frozen, without defrosting. The ultra-non-stick air circulation riser is great for grilling and air frying. The premium stainless steel reversible rack allows for multi-layer cooking. All are dishwasher safe, and the cleanup is a breeze. 100 PRE-PROGRAMMED MENU PRESETS AND CONVENIENCES BUILT-IN – Brio is programmed with 100 pre-programmed menu presets for grilling, air frying, baking, broiling, roasting, dehydrating, reheating, defrosting, toasting and more. It also has additional 50 memory slots where you can save and recall your own favorite recipes. It’s the perfect combination of capacity and versatility. Perfect for busy households on the go! LINEAR THERMAL (LINEAR T) TECHNOLOGY – Fine tune your own temperature settings from 50 degree to 400degree in precise 5degree increments. Patented Linear T Technology executes the set temperature accurately throughout the entire cooking process by continuously monitoring temperature fluctuations and making constant power adjustments every second to maintain the set temperature to ensure perfect results. Unlike the primitive methods of turning the heater on and off CHEF INSPIRED FEATURES, FUNCTIONS & RECIPES – Every feature and function of NUWAVE cooking products are created and rigorously tested by highly trained NUWAVE chefs and RD team. We obsessed over every detail in pursuit of best taste and performance. Get inspired and confidently create your own masterpieces. Brio is engineered to outperform your expectations. Whether you are cooking an appetizer, breakfast, lunch, dinner, or dessert, we have the perfect chef inspired recipe for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51puhKGzs7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B075X3287P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075X3287P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075X3287P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":578251,"name":"Slash Vintage Retro Old Fashioned Quiet Non-Ticking Sweep Second Hand, Quartz Analog Desk Clock, Battery Operated, Loud Alarm (Emerald Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k7ZntNmbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Features: Quiet, non- ticking, to ensure a good sleeping or working environment Super loud alarm sound for heavy sleepers Easy to use, easy to read, perfect for kids or seniors Specifications: Type: Retro Alarm Clock  Function: Alarm  Movement: Smooth Sweeping Quartz  Powered by: 1x AA battery (Not included) Package includes: 1 x Retro Alarm Clock Noted: 1. The two buttons to set time and alarm are designed that way. Please don't mistake the special design for the sign that they're broken or of poor quality. 2. Please use 1 AA carbon zinc battery only (alkaline battery or rechargeable battery which may have influence on the life span of clock movement, as well as the accuracy of the time). 3.There are slight difference between the picture and the real item caused by light brightness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k7ZntNmbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slash","source_asin":"B0758D9RT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0758D9RT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0758D9RT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
