window.products.push({"id":578257,"name":"Frame It Easy 13 3/4 x 14 1/2 Satin Black Metal Frame (Ashford)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SsRQk-JlL._AC_.jpg","description":"This metal picture frame is custom cut, packaged, and shipped from our 25,000 square foot warehouse in Derby, Connecticut. We pride ourselves on using quality materials to manufacture an affordable frame that is made in the USA. We ship your frame order via UPS, FedEx or USPS with extra sturdy shipping packaging. Before ordering: measure the exact height and width of your artwork in US inches. This frame can hang both vertically or horizontally. The exact measurement of your artwork 13 3/4\" (width) by 14 1/2\" (height) or 14 1/2\" (width) x 13 3/4\" (height) will fit this 13 3/4\" x 14 1/2\" frame. The frame lip will overlap the artwork edge by approximately 1/4 inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SsRQk-JlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frame It Easy","source_asin":"B07SSV88ZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SSV88ZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SSV88ZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":578258,"name":"The Princess Bride Script Mosaic Amazing Framed 8.5X11 Limited Edition Art w/COA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hVUHINMzL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is an art print image. It has a solid background color and is made entirely of The Princess Bride script. The text makes up the entire image. Even the very fine lines and what looks like shading are very small words. Super cool art piece. This is an cool framed print by pop artist Paul Van Scott. He has made rare and unusual art pieces using poker chips, golf balls, photos, political buttons, hockey pucks, M&M Candies and playing cards to name a few. He has designed and sold mosaics for over 10 years to celebrities, athletes and museums.He has created art for covers of well known magazines, music albums and company logos. Pauls work has been featured on the Fox hit TV show GLEE, college textbooks and in many news articles by outlets such as Coast To Coast AM, TMZ, The Rod Serling Foundation, Grand Illusions, Cover Magazine, Thrillist magazine and more. His \"Hank Williams Jr. bottle caps mosaic can be seen in the 2013 Matt Damon film \"Promised Land\". You won't see anything like this ANYWHERE. This is for the true collector. This listing is for a limited edition framed print directly from the artist. It is on the highest quality non-fade professional photo paper. We guarantee this to be high quality and authentic. The uniqueness of this item cannot be understood truly until you see it in person. Please view it from extremely close-up then at least 10-15 away to get the complete effect. Amazingly the farther you move it away the more detail you see. Paul has created this himself. It will NEVER be mass produced. VERY limited edition!! No more than 25 signed prints per size will EVER be released directly by the artist! You will receive a framed print along with a numbered C.O.A. that has been hand-signed by the artist. This is also available as an unframed 19X13. Ships PRIORITY mail!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hVUHINMzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Final Score Products","source_asin":"B076CQQBVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076CQQBVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076CQQBVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
