window.products.push({"id":578352,"name":"NOVICA Light Green Floral Celadon Ceramic Vase, Jade Landscape'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":277.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dGYdvyEGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Possessed by the spirit of Thai forests, this vase lends a mystical accent to a tasteful ambience. Lush petals adorn the body, the intricate composition contrasting with the smooth perfection of the flared neck. Wistful green tones complete the piece's elegant allure. Kanda works in the traditional celadon method, resulting in rich pockets of color and a lightly crackled antique appearance. - Watertight - Features a crackled finish About our Artist: Thailand's Kanda says, 'I became very interested in celadon as a result of my mother's large collection. She said each piece represented the wisdom of the ancient Thai people. I traveled to a celadon workshop to learn how to create these ceramics, and a craftsperson who was closing his workshop gave me his molds. A young sculptor, Mr. Prajuap, built the kiln and we now work together. We are also creating jobs for local craftspeople.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dGYdvyEGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00014Z6FO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00014Z6FO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00014Z6FO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
