window.products.push({"id":578387,"name":"5th Avenue Collection Tuscuny Cracked Glass Candy, Potpourri Bowl - Grape Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TxSjD5o9L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"This bowl really is all it’s cracked up to be. Turn to the 5TH AVENUE COLLECTION for truly inspired household décor pieces that instantly turn any space into a virtual art attraction. This Tuscany cracked glass bowl is a perfect example of our original creations: it elevates any floral bouquet, candy pool, or potpourri mix into something special. Display it proudly on an end table or give it the prominence it really deserves as a centerpiece in your dining or living room. It also makes a wonderfully thoughtful gift for the holiday season without putting a dent in your wallet. Flowers & Candy Never Looked Better This bowl’s impeccable Italian manufacturing complements its authentic Italian design. Fill it with fresh flowers daily, let it overflow with candy for the little ones, or simply spill into it your sensational potpourri mix. It makes everything look better. Blown, Handcrafted Cracked Glass What’s that gorgeous glass, you ask? It’s a cracked Murano glass, expertly blown and meticulously handcrafted, and put through a special cold liquid treatment that results in the eye-catching cracked look that’s totally smooth to the touch. Translucent Grape & Vine Decoration Adorned with hand-painted grapes and leaves, this bowl is a universal favorite, and is perfect for a religious wedding gift. The decoration is soft and opaque, allowing ambient and direct light to filter through and disperse pleasant hues. Starts a Conversation Every Time With its perfectly proportioned 4\" x 4\" x 7\" design and enticing looks, it is sure to start friendly conversations regardless of where you place it. Those lucky enough to receive this from you as a gift will be thankful for a long time after the fact, too. Clean Gently for Lasting Beauty The fine glass can be somewhat delicate, and it is best washed by hand with a good, non-abrasive cleanser and warm water. With just this little bit of care you can ensure that your Tuscany cracked glass bowl brings you years of happy use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TxSjD5o9L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5th Ave Store","source_asin":"B00MBM7ZM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MBM7ZM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MBM7ZM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
