window.products.push({"id":578427,"name":"RX Pharmacist Ornament 2022 – Personalized Pharmacy Gifts, Pharmacy Technician Gifts – Unique Medical Profession Christmas Tree Ornaments – RX Pharmac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BUlTPqXbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Healthcare Ornament – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our pharmacy ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a pharmacist figurine. This Christmas, express your thanks to all pharmacists for their hard work and dedication to their medical profession with this special pharmacist ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized pharmacists Christmas ornaments often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every pharmacy tech ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND pharmacist Christmas ornaments 2022 you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and your vocation. These pharmacy Christmas ornaments honor the important work that you and your loved ones do every day. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your medical ornaments will make your Christmas tree feel extra special and unique to your home. The perfect pharmacy school gifts, future pharmacist gifts, pharmacist graduation gifts and appreciation gifts for all the pharmacists in your life! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our pharmacy Christmas tree ornaments make unique pharmacist gifts for women, men and pharmacist retirement gifts to cherish every holiday season. Your pharmacist Christmas ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! Free custom personalization included with your personalized pharmacist ornament. The ultimate present for family, friends, and those who make a difference every day! Happy Pharmacists – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful nurse, pharmacist, veterinarian, paramedic and doctor ornaments for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 Christmas ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your pharmacist decor, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BUlTPqXbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07ZZFKFDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZZFKFDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZZFKFDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
