window.products.push({"id":578447,"name":"Kanwone Ceramic Japanese Ramen Bowl Set, Soup Bowls - 60 Ounce, with Matching Spoons and Chopsticks for Udon Soba Pho Asian Noodles, Set of 2, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XSNgYbnVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT SIZE FOR RAMEN LOVERS - With a generous 60 oz capacity, this ramen bowl is large and deep enough for Ramen, Pho, Udon, Soba and soup without splashed out. Great for everyday meals at home. Each bowl measures 9\" Dia. x 3.8\" H. TRADITIONAL AUTHENTIC RAMEN BOWL SET - Each set comes with spoon and chopstick which are made of wood. With this authentic Japanese style bowl set, your homemade ramen can feel like you are eating out at a traditional Asian restaurant. The spoon and chopstick are recommended to wash by hand. USER-FRIENDLY DESIGN - This Japanese noodle bowl is very user-friendly. The outside surface is surrounded by screw threads which make you easy to hold. And it is sturdy and a little bit heavy, so it won't easily get bumped to slide on the table. The fan shape design makes it stackable and does not take up much storage space. PRO-GRADE CERAMIC BOWLS - These Kanwone pho bowls are made of durable ceramic, LEAD-FREE and NON-TOXIC, chip-resistant. Microwave, oven, dishwasher, and freezer safe. A ceramic ramen bowl keeps your ramen hot for a longer period of time than its melamine or plastic counterpart. And the hand-crafted glaze looks beautiful and unique. BEST GIFT OPTION - With both traditional authentic design and practical use, this Kanwone Kanwone Pho Bowl Set is a perfect gift for your friends and family on Housewarming, Birthday party, Mothers' Day, Christmas, or any other special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XSNgYbnVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kanwone","source_asin":"B089CJL636","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CJL636","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CJL636","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
