window.products.push({"id":578525,"name":"HQRP Filter Kit compatible with Bissell 1008, 2032662, 1601502, 2032663 Style 15 Pre-motor Post-motor Filters fits Bissell Cleanview OnePass series Up","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YHg42XNAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HQRP Filter Kit - Post-Motor Pleated Filter & Pre-Motor Foam Filter - compatible with Bissell Cleanview & PowerLifter Upright Bagless Vacuum Cleaners. The Pre-motor filter is used to filter out dust and debris before they enter the motor. This part is located inside the dirt tank lid and needs to be checked and cleaned at least once a month. This filter is washable. Wash under warm water with mild detergent. Be sure the filter is completely dry before the next use. Do not operate the vacuum with wet filters! It is recommended to change with a new filter every 6 to 8 months depending on how often the filter is cleaned. The Post-motor filter fits into the post motor tray. The filter is used to obstruct dust and debris from entering the motor. This filter is not washable and should be replaced every 3 to 6 months depending on use. Compatible with Bissell parts 1008, 2032662, 1601502, 2032663 Style 15 Filters Replacement; Compatible with Bissell Cleanview 1243, 1319, 1319A, 1320, 13202, 1320A, 1322, 1327, 1328, 1328V, 1329, 1330, 13302, 1330R, 1331, 1332, 13321, 1332R, 1333, 13335, 1334, 14522, 1813, 1819, 1819R, 1820, 1822, 1823, 1824, 1825, 18252, 1825R, 1831, 1831K, 1831R, 1834, 1836, 1837, 1838, 2383, 2410, 24101, 2412, 3247, 3583, 35831, 35835, 3583R, 3918, 4207, 7482, 7636, 8531, 85312, 85321, 9595, 9595A, 95953, 95954, 95956, 95957, 9595R;Compatible with Bissell PowerLifter Rewind 1413, 1413W, PowerClean 1330K Upright Vacuum Cleaners. Disclaimer:This is not an Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM) product, HQRP branded product is a replacement. All brand names and logos are registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the brand names or model designations for this product are made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YHg42XNAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HQRP","source_asin":"B071WCGHHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071WCGHHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071WCGHHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":578526,"name":"Footontt Cartoon Elephant Blackout Curtains for Kids Bedroom, Thermal Insulated Grommet Blackout Baby Elephant Curtains Drapes for Boys Girls Bedroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lug4nZjaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Thermal Curtains are crafted from premium durable polyester and completed with a grommet construction to create elegant, loose drapey folds. Our block-out curtains are the perfect combination of fashion and performance. These curtains are available in a selection of sizes and beautiful vibrant colors. MULTIFUNCTION: Draperies are thick enough to blocks out unwanted light and noise, encouraging day sleepers and the ones who have trouble falling asleep have a good sleep. Not only that but also make your resting zone truly blissful. They would be perfect for any home theater and supply you with the enjoyment of watching TV in real darkness. The sophisticated designs allow you to brighten your home decor, making your living space more lively. Protect your furniture, floors, and artwork from the ravages of the sun. Energy Saving Curtains have kept the room much warmer in winter and also block a lot of heat during summer, relieving the strain on home heating and cooling while reducing energy budget. Fabric & Care Machine Washable. Gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Warm Iron For any questions about the product, please contact us. We’re always here to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lug4nZjaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Footontt","source_asin":"B09CQ5JJJ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CQ5JJJ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CQ5JJJ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":578527,"name":"Hamilton Beach 49995 FlexBrew Single Serve Coffeemaker (Discontinued)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GAVRNLjzL._AC_.jpg","description":"Hamilton Beach FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker - 49995 For all the adventurous coffee drinkers out there, there's finally a coffee-brewing machine that can satisfy the tastebuds in three different ways. The FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker allows the flexibility of brewing freshly ground coffee one minute or an instant K-Cup pack or coffee pod the next. With its revolutionary method of brewing, the FlexBrew Single-Serve coffeemaker is the ideal solution for coffee drinkers who value flexibility in their morning routine. A new favorite among coffee enthusiasts for its convenience and user-friendly features, the FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker costs only pennies to make fresh-ground coffee and boasts a major advantage over other single-serve brewers: a removable K-Cup pack holder to allow for pre-measured and pre-packaged coffee. PRODUCT FEATURE BENEFITS Compatible with coffee grounds, K-Cup packs or soft pods Compatible with coffee grounds, K-Cup packs or soft pods Better coffee extraction than the leading competitor Better coffee extraction than the leading competitor Adjustable cup rest allows for standard-size cups or travel mugs Adjustable cup rest allows for standard-size cups or travel mugs Durable, stainless steel features and dishwasher safe, removable parts Durable, stainless steel features and dishwasher safe, removable parts 10-oz. brewing capacity (travel mug not included) 10-oz. brewing capacity (travel mug not included) Coffeemaker shuts off automatically when brew cycle is complete Coffeemaker shuts off automatically when brew cycle is complete Equipped with a \"Quick Start\" Guide with simple, step-by-step brewing guidelines Equipped with a \"Quick Start\" Guide with simple, step-by-step brewing guidelines Customer service support available through a US toll-free number Customer service support available through a US toll-free number Brewing with a K-Cup Pack For some java drinkers, pouring fresh-ground coffee into their coffeemaker is the perfect start to their day. For other coffee lovers, being able to quickly insert a pre-packaged, single portion pack into their coffeemaker and enjoy a piping hot cup in a few minutes is a match made in heaven. The FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker offers the added convenience factor of a pack holder, which allows quick instant brewing in less time than an in-store café experience. Simply insert the K-Cup pack and push the lever down – that's it. Brewing with Ground Coffee Pre-packaged coffee isn't for everyone or every palate. The FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker caters to coffee aficionados by featuring a steel mesh scoop filter that holds a variety of fresh-tasting ground coffee. You can grind your own coffee beans to the medium-grind setting or save time and purchase pre-ground coffee. Brands such as Folders, Maxwell House, Dunkin' Donuts, and Starbucks are recommended because they are medium-grind coffees. Note: Coffee that is ground too finely will cause an overflow. If you are unsure about the coarseness of your coffee, check with your coffee manufacturer. Alternative Options to Coffee Not a coffee drinker or prefer other varieties of hot beverages? The FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker, unlike home-brewers that solely brew their own type of coffee, allows for a variety of tea pods, including herbal, chai, white, green, black and flavorful blends. Measuring Portions Appropriately Not sure how much coffee grinds to add when brewing your next cup? No worries, the unit comes equipped with a brew basket, marked with a 2- tablespoon MAX line for exact measuring, so there's no overspilling. For busier schedules, use the K-Cup pack holder, which is already portioned for single servings. About Homemade Brewing Did you know that 86 percent of coffee drinkers still brew most of their java at home? With more and more Americans picking up the coffee habit, staying awake longer, and cutting back to save money, coffeemakers are now being designed to be more feasible and economical for the home budget and lifestyle. *Source: 2012, National Coffee Association of USA TIPS & CARE The FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker performs best with medium-grind coffee; coffee that is too finely ground may affect the extraction time or filtering process. Keep ground coffee below MAX fill line and do not use more than 10 ounces (410 ml) of water. When using the K-Cup pack holder, press down on the edge of the pack until the pack clicks into place and the hole is punched in the bottom – do not remove foil. Allow two minutes to cool in-between brews. The brew basket and K-Cup pack holder should be rinsed after every use. Removable parts, such as the K-Cup Pack Holder, Handle and Lock, drip tray, cup rest and basket itself, are all dishwasher safe. For trouble-free maintenance, the FlexBrew Single-Serve Coffeemaker should be cleaned internally once a month, by pouring ½ cup plain white vinegar and ½ cup cold water into the water reservoir, brewing and then running 2-3 cycles of cold","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GAVRNLjzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B07C9HPFWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C9HPFWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C9HPFWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
