window.products.push({"id":578782,"name":"Stratton Home Decor S39170 Wall Decor, 23.50 X 0.50 X 23.50, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PaEAZNzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get a free-spirited vibe running in your home with the right boho-themed wall decor. After a long day at work, it just feels good to chill out and lounge in your home. Having a boho-inspired home design makes your living space feel more comfortable and relaxing, and promotes a feeling of peace and calmness. If you are looking to upgrade the look of your boho-themed indoors, this macrame wall decor will make an excellent choice. Highlight the carefree atmosphere of your home with the Stratton Home Decor Half Circle Wood Macrame Wall Decor. Turn that blank spot on your wall into the focal point of your home. This wall art decor features a medium-dark, wooden half-circle that is detailed with cream-colored twisted macrame tassels. This art piece will look stunning in your living room, bedroom, study, or hallway. Measuring 23.5 W x .5 D x 23.5 H inches, this art piece is made of 70% MDF wood veneer and 30% rope. Need more time to make a decision? Here are more reasons to love this wall decor: ✅ Sturdy, durable construction ✅ Works with a farmhouse or rustic-themed home decor ✅ Hangs vertically Enchant your living space with a chic, boho vibe. Add the Stratton Home Decor Half Circle Wood Macrame Wall Decor to your cart NOW","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PaEAZNzPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stratton Home Décor","source_asin":"B08S5CG5W5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S5CG5W5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S5CG5W5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":578783,"name":"Rae Dunn Summer Gnome - Decorations for Home - Summer Home Decor - Farmhouse Kitchen - Stuffed Gnomes Plush Shelf Figurines - Gnome Decor Mother's Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CxfldcJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hey summer, long time no sea! Where there’s a will, there’s a wave. Be shore to have the best summer ever and decorate for the season with Rae Dunn gnome decorations! Keep palm and carry on. Life is way better in slow m-ocean. Guys say, “Yeah buoy” while girls just wanna have sun! Be careful, reading a book while sunbathing will make you well-red.PRODUCT FEATURES:Summer GnomePlush Gnome DecorShelf Sized DecorationDimensions: 7” x 5.25” x 19”AVAILABLE STYLES:\"Live. Love. Tennis.\"\"Vitamin Sea\"\"Pool Time\"\"Gone Fishin\"CUDDLY CUTE DECOROur nifty gnomes are soft and sturdy with a weighted fabric design that ensures they stay standing upright. Padded fabric body and tiny plush hands are a delight to squeeze, with a cute wooden nose and themed outfit to complete the look. Adorn shelves, bedrooms, desktops, offices, tables, fireplace mantel, windowsills, bookcases, refrigerator, furniture, and nooks & crannies throughout the home with these adorable figurines.SCANDINAVIAN GOOD LUCK GIFTIn Swedish and Scandinavian homes, gnomes or “tomten” can stand for good fortune, respect, and care. Stories about these creatures often talk about how much they appreciate people looking after their properties and farms and being good to the animals that live there. Give a gift of good luck to friends, family, coworkers, or teachers.RAE DUNNCalifornia artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn, finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. \"In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.Rae's designs are known for their functionality, design, and durability. Rae's signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CxfldcJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B0B1VWFV5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1VWFV5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1VWFV5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
