window.products.push({"id":578808,"name":"Unique Ceramic Coffee Mug Set: Stylish Diamond Shaped Mugs with a Speckled White Matte Finish - Ceramic Cups for Coffee, Tea, Hot Chocolate & More - H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416fAwkUTBL._AC_.jpg","description":"SIP IN STYLE  You’ll always sip in style with this beautiful set of ceramic coffee cups. SoulQUEEN is keeping things hot with their fashionable and functional coffee mug sets that make any beverage Instagram worthy. From their matte white finish and speckled design to their fun and unique diamond shape, you never have to worry about your morning coffee being basic again. They’re also dishwasher safe for fast, easy cleaning so you can go about your day.   DRINKS FOR 2  SoulQUEEN knows that while you’re an independent boss babe, drinks for 2 can be so much fun. Share a cup of coffee over morning talks with your fellow boss babes or sip herbal tea on a chilly day while snuggled up with bae. Taking your mugs to work? Offer a coworker or client a cup of coffee that doesn’t come in boring paper cups.   KEEP IT HOT  Stay warm when it gets chilly with ceramic mugs made to keep your favorite drinks hot. Each SoulQUEEN mug is made of 100% ceramic, and since ceramic has a low conduction rate, your coffee, tea, hot chocolate, or any other warm drink will stay warmer for longer. No more yucky lukewarm drinks!   DIAMOND DELIGHT  Looking for that one piece to really make a room shine? These cups have a sleek diamond design perfect for home, kitchen or office decor. Make them a statement piece next to your coffeemaker, or place them on coasters in your living room for display. You can also keep one on your desk with all of your favorite pens.   10 OUNCES  Nothing is worse than having too much or too little of your favorite drink. You could be left savoring that last drop of a caramel macchiato or mourning your oolong as it goes down the drain. Luckily, these novelty mugs have a 10 oz (280 ml) capacity so you're never short on your favorite beverage. Fill up on the perfect amount of hot coffee, chai tea, or a hot toddy if you’re feeling under the weather. Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416fAwkUTBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"soulQUEEN","source_asin":"B07D33P5HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-578808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D33P5HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D33P5HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
